'''Rain D.''' (ナカイくん, ''Nakai-kun'') is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in [[The Aku Realms]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 2.0 Update|Version 2.0]].

